# Base URL of the deployed .NET backend (no trailing slash).
# - Local dev: point at your locally running backend, e.g. http://localhost:8080
# - Render production: the backend service's Render URL, e.g. https://chokh-backend.onrender.com
# Only the public backend URL belongs here — never put API keys or secrets in a VITE_ variable,
# since anything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the client-side JavaScript.
VITE_API_URL=https://YOUR-BACKEND-RENDER-URL.onrender.com
